{"version":1,"content":"<p>一篇呼籲董事會考慮員工對英偉達前行政總裁看法的內部帖子，已收到超過1600條評論，其中絕大多數支持讓黃仁勳重新出任CEO。據內部通信顯示，儘管黃仁勳被曝出多起婚外情並突然辭職，仍有部分英偉達員工呼籲他回歸。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586252.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:38:32.558572+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T08:13:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T08:31:48.118174+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T08:31:48.118174+00:00","content_hash":"046a90dbafbe7132985ffd4faca07ba6961e0deb99197aa29c8705b38b86c845","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}